      "side": 1,
      "message": "regarding #2... if this is true, isn\u0027t that case already broken for VIVT? This new code isn\u0027t doing anything to bring in the lines for those user-space addresses into the cache. If VIVT has been broken for years, it doesn\u0027t seem like we need to add an exclusion in Kconfig.",
