      "writtenOn": "2018-08-13T22:39:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The entire cache is flushed on process context switch on vivt (arm) systems. Since the current driver never writes to a buffer that is shared with user-space from the same process, it works without any additional cache flushes.",
      "parentUuid": "3b7fe55d_b25c395f",
      "revId": "5991bb5cec3cf9e6ab3ab4238ee58fe640f27b2c",
