      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok, that does make sense. Sigh.\n\nGreg, this is going to get really complex for an arch that we don\u0027t actually run android on and have no way to test... so I think I\u0027m back with Arve that the best thing to do is punt and just cause binder not to compile on this known-bad architecture.\n\nMind if I put back the Kconfig to exclude binder if VIVT?\n\nI\u0027ll also add a comment in the code about this.",
